blurb = "Depicts a view of the Taj Mahal, in Agra, India, seen from its garden. A reflecting pool runs through the center of the image.

The building, a mausoleum for Mumtaz Mahal, the wife of Shah Jahan, was finished in 1648 and is currently open to visitors."
